SMS — immediate: Hey {{contact.name}}, It's [Company Name]. Thanks for booking a time to speak with us; your call is at {{appointment.start_time}} Meeting Link: {{appointment.meeting_location}} Please reply back with "YES" to confirm you'll show up.

Email — immediate: Hey {{contact.name}}, It's [Company Name]. Thanks for booking a time to speak with us; your call is at {{appointment.start_time}} Meeting Link: {{appointment.meeting_location}}

Set the sender email to the Client's own business address — it must be added to their GoHighLevel staff list first. Subject line pattern: Important message from [Company Name].

12 hours before: Hey {{contact.name}}, It's [Company Name]. Thanks for booking a time to speak with us; your call is at {{appointment.start_time}} Meeting Link: {{appointment.meeting_location}}

6 hours before: Hey {{contact.name}} just another friendly reminder of our call coming up soon in the next 6 hours. Here's the meeting link just to make it easier! {{appointment.meeting_location}}

3 hours before: Hey {{contact.name}} Just sending the link again just in case you missed it. {{appointment.meeting_location}}

1 hour before: Hey {{contact.name}} I'm hopping on in an hour. Here is the link below! {{appointment.meeting_location}}
